			"notes": "### Added\n- [Farm & Charm](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-farm-charm)'s cutting board is a station: food is cut on its marks, logs stripped with an axe and dishes laid together layer by layer.\n- [Wok & Bowl](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-wok-bowl)'s wok is a station: the food is thrown in, tossed by a flick of the handle, sauced and flambéed.\n- [Corn Expansion](https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-addon-corn-expansion)'s recipes work at the stations: corn dough in the bowl, cornmeal and flour at the mincer, polenta and cornbread on the stove, its dishes on the board.\n\n### Changed\n- The mincer mills grain, corn, crops and bones into meal or flour with dust and a dry sound instead of meat juice.\n- Corn syrup is poured from its bottle wherever honey is.\n\n### Fixed\n- Minced meat is pressed out of the mincer's die in strands and lies thick on the heap, as on 1.20.1.\n- Opening Farm & Charm's stove no longer crashes the game alongside [Decorative Blocks](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks), and the stove takes every modded fuel a furnace takes."
		},
